'''Slipstream''' is a beneficial [[ground effect]] that increases the [[action speed]] of everything standing on it.

It can generate from the following sources:
*{{sl|Arcane Wake}} skill from {{il|Worldcarver}}

==See also==
*{{sl|Summon Harbinger of Time}} an item skill that grants {{stl|The Flow Untethered}} aura buff, which is visually the same as Slipstream
*{{sl|Summon Greater Harbinger of Time}} an item skill that grants {{stl|The Torrent's Reclamation}} aura buff, which is visually the same as Slipstream, but does not affect enemies

==Version history==
The version that granted from [[sextant]], which is not obtainable in the current version of the game, is stackable.<ref name="SextantMods"/>

